{"version":1,"key":"card:639","content":{"id":639,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先要明白两个概念："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"click","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件的 300ms 延迟"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在早期互联网，当时的网站都是为 PC 端设计了，在移动端中，用户往往需要通过双击来放大页面，而为了区分用户的单击还是双击，在第一点击屏幕时（"},{"type":"formatted","text":"touchend","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"）并不会立即触发 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"click","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件，而是会等待 300ms，在 300ms 内如果用户再次点击，则会触发双击缩放，如果没有则会触发 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"click","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"点击穿透"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设存在一个模态窗口，当你点击关闭按钮时，为了立即关闭会监听 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"touchend","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件将窗口隐藏，但是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"click","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件并没有发生，等到 300 ms 后，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"click","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件触发，但是此时上层的模态窗口已经不存在了，点击事件就触发到了下层的元素，这就是点击穿透"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因此点击事件的 300ms 延迟是因，而点击穿透是果，只要解决了 300ms 毫秒延迟，点击穿透的问题就迎刃而解了。由于随着移动设备的普及，大部分网站已转向移动端优先，所以双击放大的需求大大减少，而点击延迟也极大地影响用户体验。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那么如何解决 300ms 的延迟呢："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设置 Viewport Meta 标签"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现代浏览器已经约定，如果页面被明确标记为移动端友好（即不需要缩放），那么浏览器就可以禁用双击缩放，取消 300ms 的延迟，这个属性就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"user-scalable=no","code":true},{"text":"，现代浏览器的首选方案","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">","language":"HTML","uuid":"de2565e6-c82f-4513-985f-413dd086ea61","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 JavaScript 库"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"viewport","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方案普及之前，大家都会使用一个 Fastclick.js 的库，它会在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"touchend","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件上注册一个监听器，当 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"touchend","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 触发时，它会创建一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"click","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件，并且 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dispatch","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个事件，并且阻止 300ms 后的原生 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"click","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在现代浏览器中已无必要，甚至可能和浏览器的原生优化冲突，且库已多年不维护"}]}]}]}],"tags":["前端/技巧","浏览器/踩坑","踩坑/浏览器"],"createTime":1762866059803,"updateTime":1765546726904,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1765546726904}}